+Port=0x0000, the MRI will apply to a specific port, whose value is
+not yet known.  If neither of A or B is set, the word is absent.</dd>
+              <dt pn="section-a.3.1.1-3.27">D-flag:</dt>
+              <dd pn="section-a.3.1.1-3.28">The Direction flag has the following meaning: the value 0
+means 'in the same direction as the flow' (i.e., downstream), and
+the value 1 means 'in the opposite direction to the flow' (i.e.,
+upstream).</dd>
+            </dl>
+            <t indent="0" pn="section-a.3.1.1-4">The MRI format defines a number of constraints on the allowed
 combinations of flags and fields in the object.  If these constraints
