-Error&quot; message (Appendix A.4.4.10) with subcode 2 (&quot;Invalid Flag-
-Field Combination&quot;) <bcp14>MUST</bcp14> be returned.</t>
+Error&quot; message (Appendix A.4.4.10) with subcode 2 (&quot;Invalid Flag-Field Combination&quot;) <bcp14>MUST</bcp14> be returned.</t>
